window.products.push({"id":792016,"name":"Yopay Clear Cupboard Liner, 12 Inch x 40 Feet Non-Adhesive Drawer Liners, Waterproof EVA Refrigerator Mat for Kitchen, Shelf, Pantry, Laundry Room, Of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eudfTY+-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multiple Usage - Yopay clear cupboard liner is great for your cabinet, drawer, refrigerator or shelf or as placemat and coaster. Use the cabinet liner in your kitchen, pantry, work station, laundry room, cupboard, table, shelves, counter top, office space and more. Our non adhesive drawer liner come with two rolls, each roll is 12 Inch x 20 Feet, 40 Feet long in total, they can be easily cut to any size and shape to meet your need with a scissor or a knife and then place the liner down in your drawer or desk and trim off any excess material. Durable and Safe Material - The refrigerator mat is made of environmentally friendly EVA material, durable and reusable, the shelf liner is non adhesive and durable without odor and BPA. You can safe to be used in contact with fruit and vegetable directly. Waterproof and Easy to Clean - Our clear shelf liners provide durable and water-resistant protection, they protect your drawer from spilled water, oil and the other liquid, When the drawer liner get dirty, just use wet cloth with water to wipe the dirty off, or wash it with water. Novel Design and Non Adhesive - The cabinet drawer liner is designed with dots texture on one side, and the other side is a smooth surface. The smooth side is non-adhesive so you can easily remove the liner; Non-adhesive textured top and grip bottom holds liner and objects in place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61eudfTY+-S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yopay","source_asin":"B08HYKP3CK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HYKP3CK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HYKP3CK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":792017,"name":"Wonder Hanger Platinum, Space-Saving Closet Organizers, 4 Pack, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615lZVLDJeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NEATLY ORGANIZES & DECLUTTERS YOUR CLOSET: If you’re tired of a cluttered closet, Wonder Hanger Platinum can help. These hangers are designed to provide optimal organization and storage, giving you greater space in your home. Each Wonder Hanger Platinum holds up to 30 pounds and has 6 notches in it to hold multiple hangers. EASY TO USE: The Wonder Hanger Platinum can be hung horizontally or vertically for easy closet organization. Just drop down the Wonder Hanger Platinum by pulling one of the hooks off the closet rod. Your clothes will remain neatly on the hanger while hanging vertically. This system triples your closet space, keeps clothes neat, and gives you more room to fit and organize your seasonal clothes. HOLDS 12 GARMENTS PER HANGER: Each Wonder Hanger Platinum features 6 evenly spaced slots to hold your hangers. These notches are wide enough for you to double up on hangers, making it so that each Wonder Hanger Platinum holds 12 garments. It also helps prevent wrinkles. With this handy 4 pack, that’s a total of 48 garments that you can accommodate easily !! GREAT FOR SMALL SPACES: When you have limited room, space is a precious commodity. Fortunately, our hangers are designed to maximize your closet space, giving you ample room to hang all your garments. The Wonder Hanger Platinum is ideal for small closets, apartments, dorm rooms, RVs, and storage. Finally, you can hang up all your clothes without your space feeling cluttered. 4 PACK: We’ve made ordering your set of Wonder Hanger Platinum hangers easier for you. This convenient set comes in a 4 pack, giving you ample room to hang all of your clothes and garments. You can store wood, wire, or plastic hangers on the Wonder Hanger Platinum. The Wonder Hanger Platinum can also be used for coats, purses, and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615lZVLDJeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wonder Hanger","source_asin":"B07CJL3V95","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CJL3V95","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CJL3V95","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
