window.products.push({"id":792120,"name":"IPKIG Power Recliner Chair with Massage and Heat, Electric Recliner Chair for Elderly/Adults with Cup Holders, USB Ports, 4 Side Pockets & 2 Remote Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":379.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FUkCiff9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"POWER RECLINER CHAIR: The simple back design and modern fabric looks elegant and brings a good visual hierarchy, update your room instantly. With just the push of a button, then great simultaneous powdered recline of chair back while the footrest is raised, smooth reclining function for optimal comfort. This recliner chair is an dependable relaxation solution for you, it can reclines up to 150 degree. (With lift function.) VIBRATION MASSAGE & SOOTHING HEATING: This power recliner chair comes with 4 areas of massage(back, thigh, lumbar, leg), you can use all or choose individually for full body relaxing at once, 5 intensities are available. It also comes 1 heating part in the waist area, make your waist warm and sooth the body. (Heating function works separately with vibration.) SOFT FABRIC & OVERSTUFFED PADDING: The recliner sofa chair for living room has a thick and wide backrest, cushions, and armrests. Lining Springs with Overstuffed backrest and seat cushion will bring you more comfortable, just like the whole body is wrapped up in recliner chair. Treated fabric surface will bring a warm and soft tactile impression, also certain effect of anti-felting and anti-pilling. USB CHARGE PORT & SIDE POCKETS: Equipped with USB port, keeps your devices charging, you have no worry your phone or iPad out of power while sit on our chair. The power recliner chair with pockets on both sides provides ample space for storing your phone, ipad, books or other small items and is convenient within reach. 2 cups holders on both armrests also meet your need.(Notes: The USB ports ONLY for low-power devices, such as iPhone, iPad) WARM TIPS - BUY WITH CONFIDENCE: 1. With lift function; 2. Max reclining angle: 150°; 3. The recliner chair comes in 2 boxes and we ship them on the same day but the carrier may deliver on different days; 4. Recommended Height: 5'1\"-5'9''. 5. 1 year warranty. If you have any problem, please feel free to contact our friendly customer team, they will resolve your concerns in 24 hours. Comes with assemble instructions, very easy to assemble and usually only need 10-15mins to finish the installation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FUkCiff9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IPKIG","source_asin":"B0BGXZ5WCT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792120","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGXZ5WCT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGXZ5WCT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
