window.products.push({"id":792127,"name":"Fiumara Apparel 3 Pocket Waist Apron 12\" L x 23\" W -Made in USA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713AqrCgTQL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"65/35 Poly/Cotton Made in USA Drawstring closure machine wash MADE IN THE USA: There is nothing better than premium American made products. This unisex server apron is constructed in the United States with pride, and great attention to detail. YES, there still are garments made in the United States. DURABLE, WELL MADE: These popular three pocket waist aprons are made of high quality American 7.5 oz. 65/35 poly/cotton twill fabric. Function comes with these aprons too; three pockets 8\" Deep Pockets on the front allow for ample storage and space for whatever employees may need. All waist Apron fabric has a Canvas like feel for Durability. Unlike many imported products, our Fiumara aprons do not use “heat fused” tie ends, but is quality crafted by using better made “finished” tie ends. UNIQUE FABRIC: This waist apron offers appearance and function for those who prefer a classic look. With reinforced bar tacking to keep the apron held together and looking professional, any server or chef can't go wrong with this choice. This waist apron has stain and wrinkle resistant finish, color steadfast for vibrant colors through many wash cycles. Maintenance is a breeze with this apron having sturdy bar tacking at all stress points and being 100% machine washable. UNISEX SIZING: This professional grade Fiumara waist apron is made for both men and women. This waist apron from Fiumara Apparel offers a basic yet classic appearance for server and chef uniforms. It measures 12\" in length and 23\" in width and is provided with the 37\" extra-long waist ties which can wrap around and tie in front or back to fit any chef or server. The precision cut patterns and reinforced stress points are meticulously sewn by our proud team in our USA factory. IDEAL FOR WAITSTAFF - This is a popular apron for food service workers.The 3 pocket design enables waiters, waitresses & bartenders to separate their needed items to service their customers, and reach for them with ease.The aprons have soil release and wrinkle resistant finish, and have sturdy bar tacking at all stress points to keep your chef or server looking professional and presentable all shift long.These aprons are manufactured in USA with American fabric and are available in 8 stock color","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713AqrCgTQL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fiumara Apparel","source_asin":"B07BQYSN7F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BQYSN7F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BQYSN7F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
