window.products.push({"id":792293,"name":"Nag Champa Incense Sticks Punk Heavily Scented Handmade ~ Bulk Wholesale ~ 100 Pack ~","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Rb7U6iLbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All Incense sticks are handmade! We use grade A fragrance oils to aide in our process of making the best possible scented Incense Sticks OUR PROCESS For every order it takes approximately 24-48 hours for the incense stick to absorb the scent, depending on the size of the order. We then allow the scented incense sticks to dry for another 24-48 hours for optimal burning. (If the incense sticks are still a little wet upon arrival, take them out of their bag and lay them in a sunny area to allow the complete drying of the sticks.) After we count 25 sticks for every package, and 4 packs for ever order of 100. Please allow up to 5 Business days for your order to ship.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Rb7U6iLbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Burn My Candle","source_asin":"B0871223JM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0871223JM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0871223JM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":792294,"name":"Weta Workshop Krampus Cherub Tree Topper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31tgXgQEyPL._AC_.jpg","description":"In Legendary Pictures' Krampus, young Max unwittingly unleashes the wrath of Krampus a demonic force of ancient evil intent on punishing non-believers. All hell breaks loose as beloved holiday icons take on a monstrous life of their own! Weta Workshop contributed design and practical effects to this darkly festive tale of a yuletide ghoul. Our unique products are designed by the same artists who have worked on the film themselves.~Krampus is coming, and hes left a very special delivery in a grimy sack at the front door. Dont bring it in because hidden inside are all manner of Christmas beasties, including a cherub who is anything but cherubic. Close inspection reveals a cracked face, bloodshot eyes, sharp teeth, beastly eagle talons and clawed feet details that cut right through this characters cute first appearances. Make no mistake, this is not a creature you want to meet in the dark attic on a cold Christmas Eve. Dont go up there.Krampus Up Your Christmas! No Christmas is complete without a sparkly range of ornaments for your tree. But this is Weta Workshop. We dont do sparkly.New from our team of ghouls, goblins, and the hardest-working elves in the Southern Hemisphere a range of Krampus ornaments snatched right out of director Michael Dougherty freakishly fun film! Including baubles, plushies & hellipeven a Christmas tree topper crafted out of our main currency, nightmares.And what better time to launch this wicked new range of goodies than on everyones second favourite family holiday Halloween? The Cherub Tree TopperShe sees you when youre sleeping...A tree topper with a twist. From our new range of Krampus Christmas ornaments, the Cherub Tree Topper is the macabre icing on your festive cake. Perch her on top of your decked-out Christmas tree or keep her close by on your desktop. One things for sure. With this devious little angel ready to wreak havoc, youre sure to have a very... eventful Christmas indeed. The Cherub Tree Topper is an Open Edition piece.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31tgXgQEyPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Weta Workshop","source_asin":"B079HGPY43","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079HGPY43","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079HGPY43","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
