window.products.push({"id":792436,"name":"Wrapables AllyBag Collection Reusable Shopping Bag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rDCXt6pgL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Nylon Imported Nylon lining No Closure closure Machine Wash Multi-Use Reusable Bag. These reusable bags can be used over and over again. Use these stylish and eye-catching bags for groceries, as a book bag, running errands, or shopping in general. Water Resistant Material. Made with nylon that is water resistant and machine washable (however, hand wash is recommended for extending the life of the bag). Durable. With its double-layered reinforced handles and seamless bottom, the bag can hold up to 44 pounds. Dimensions. Bag,17.25\"L x 19.88\"W. Inner Pocket, 5.5\"L x 5.5\"W. Handle, approximately 10 inches long. Inner Pocket. The inner pocket can be used to hold your personal items such as your phone, wallet and keys. Fold up the bag into the inner pocket when not in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rDCXt6pgL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wrapables","source_asin":"B0BHCV8D9D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHCV8D9D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHCV8D9D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":792437,"name":"Costzon Electric Ice Shaver, 250W Stainless Steel Snow Cone Maker, 440LBS/H, Ice Crusher w/Safe On/Off Switch for Family, School, Church, Restaurants,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JIdtXi8xL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Stainless Steel Construction- Made of premium steel material, you can use this ice shaver machine for many years without the fear of rust. Purchase one with good quality to avoid future defect. Equipped with TWO Commercial Grade 420 Alloy Steel Shaving Blades, it works efficiently at the productivity of around 440 lbs per hour to shave no matter large or small ice cubes. It will help you save plenty of time and enjoy the sweets earlier than expected. Water-Resistant “On / Off” Switch For Safe Operation - There is a lid on the switch to keep water away. You can stop it at your convenience securely even after a long period of its working time. Simple & Convenient Operation: Just drop the ice in the hopper, push the handle, and the shaving work is done! Stainless Steel Holding Bowl will hold all your \" fruitful success\". Even if you are a rookie mom who is desired to make cold drinks for your kids, it is extraordinarily easy to handle. Power: 250W, Rotated Speed: 2500 Runs/Min, Shaving/Crushing Capacity: 440 lbs per hour","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JIdtXi8xL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Costzon","source_asin":"B01JKNRJTM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792437","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JKNRJTM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JKNRJTM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":792438,"name":"Much ADO About Nothing. A Tribute to Seinfeld Giclée Print (12 x 16)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1amkLOpXTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"Much Ado About Nothing,'' is another one where I take pop culture icons and put them in a Baroque setting. Baroque is my favorite art period. In Baroque paintings women were always white and men were rugged and tan, the paintings had contrast between intense light and dark shadows. Women would be dead center in the painting and their skin would be bright white, so the first thing you see when you look at the painting is the shape of a woman's torso. Elaine is in the center and you see her immediately. Jerry, Kramer and George are darker and covered, like men would be in Baroque paintings. When I first started working on a Seinfeld image, I did a lot of drawings of them in Jerry's apartment, as they were on the show. Then I kind of came upon this and went with it.\" Original painting. Pencil and gouache on fine art paper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1amkLOpXTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"O'keefe Prints","source_asin":"B075FBR1M5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075FBR1M5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075FBR1M5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
