window.products.push({"id":792525,"name":"The Original Cider-Tasting Mug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51H51gyPmuL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"When I began working on my cider-tasting notebook, 33 Mugs of Cider, I drank a lot of craft cider. I fell in love with the liquid I was sampling, but I quickly realized that cider lacks an important element of drinking culture – a vessel with which to appreciate it. After all, wine has the goblet. Brandy, the snifter. Beer has the stein, and the pint glass, and the ... you get the idea. I tried sampling cider using my not-small collection of beer and wine glasses, but nothing seemed quite right. So I set out to create something purpose-built to enhance the experience of drinking craft cider. This is what I came up with. I hope you enjoy it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51H51gyPmuL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"33 Books Co.","source_asin":"B01N2GHW8I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N2GHW8I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N2GHW8I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
