window.products.push({"id":792557,"name":"Okin Wireless Remote Replacement Hand Control for Electric Adjustable Beds RF.27.19.33","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e97DSnymL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Okin Remote Control for Adjustable Beds Replacement Please matching code before you use it. ①How to Match Code?  Step 1. Unplug the power for 5 seconds, plug on. Indicator of control box turns blue, and under-bed light flashes ( if has). Control box turns to matching code model. Step 2. Press and hold PAIR button on remote control, the backlight of remote flashes, remote control turns to matching mode. Hold till the backlight stop flashes and is always on (or the under-bed light stops flashing and goes out). Code matching is completed. NOTE: When control box is plug on again, it is on the code matching mode for the first 10 seconds. If code has been successfully matched before, no need to match again. After 10 seconds, the control box's indicator turns green (or the under-bed light stops flashing and goes out), you can directly control the bed with remote control. ②How to Match Code? Step 1. Double click the code pairing button on control box, indicator of control box turns blue, and under-bed light flashes ( if has). Control box turns to matching code model.  Step 2. Press and hold PAIR button on remote control, the backlight of remote flashes, remote control turns to matching mode. Hold till the backlight stop flashes and is always on (or the under-bed light stops flashing and goes out). Code matching is completed.  NOTE: If code matching is not completed and overtime, please repeat above actions until it is finished.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61e97DSnymL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Okin","source_asin":"B0995SMS2L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792557","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0995SMS2L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0995SMS2L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
