window.products.push({"id":792562,"name":"charcoal odor absorber(6 Packs), Activated air purifying bags, Natural activated charcoal bags, bamboo charcoal bags, Efficient Odor Eliminators for H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WX1-NQTbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our closet odor eliminator is long time recyclable and eco-friendly, harmless, non-fragrances, chemicals free, and safe for your family. Bamboo charcoal is strong and efficient to eliminate odor and purify the air. It is very easy to use and suit for multiple uses. Enjoy Breathing in the fresh air every day. Why MaxRona charcoal air purifying bag is the best choice for you? ►Air purifier bags bamboo charcoal is made from activated bamboo charcoal that is nature and Eco-friendly material. Charcoal air freshener bag is harmless for the family with pregnant women, babies and pets. ►Charcoal bags is 10X more porous than regular charcoal. That means charcoal deodorizer bags is strong and efficient to eliminate odor. ►Charcoal air purifier bags are long time Recyclable and Eco-friendly. Place your activated bamboo charcoal bags in sunlight for hours once a month to revitalize them for up to 2 years. You can also use the activated bamboo charcoal bags for fertilizer in your garden after two years. ►These charcoal shoe deodorizer bags are multiple uses, they can help to absorb sweat and body odor, absorb odors from shoes, fridge, car, etc. Put bamboo charcoal bags odor absorber in the sealing space to absorb harmful formaldehyde. ►The Best after-sales service: We offer 24 hours serve for customer. If you have any problem with our charcoal bags, just send email to us, we will solve the problem for you in hurry. Where can I use green charcoal bags? ►Charcoal air freshener bags are multi-using, you can use it for your smelly shoes, boots, shoebox, bags, luggage, drawers, closets, laundry area, pantry cabinet, car, bathrooms and more! I think charcoal air purifier bags will give you a nice living environment! Package Including：3PACKS 200g 3PACKS 75g Weight：200g (0.44lb) per bag","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WX1-NQTbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MaxRona","source_asin":"B088QDS6CC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088QDS6CC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088QDS6CC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
