window.products.push({"id":792575,"name":"Craig Frames 200ASHBK Wood Grain Finish 12 by 19-Inch Picture/Poster Frame, 0.75-Inch Wide, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iSnvkznwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This brand new picture frame is manufactured in the USA at our facility in Ithaca, Michigan using the best materials and tools available. Our picture and poster frames LARGER THAN OR EQUAL TO 12x18 Inch (inside dimensions) include clear STYRENE facing, a rigid cardboard backing and hanging hardware. Some assembly is required to attach the hanging hardware to the frame. Visit our seller info page for assembly instructions. Hanging hardware includes: (2) 1\" Nails, (1) 30# capacity Wall Hanger, (1) 4' length of Hanging Wire, (2) D-Rings, (2) 1/2\" Screws. Before hanging your frame, please remember to peel off the blue protective film from the styrene facing (or acrylic facing if you upgraded) for maximum clarity. Our picture frames will compliment any space that you hang them in, they make great gifts and they will protect and display your photographs and artwork for years to come. If you have any questions or comments, please do not hesitate to contact us. Feel free to visit our storefront and seller info pages to browse our extensive selection of frames, read customer feedback or review our policies and contact info. At the end of the day we want you to be completely happy with your purchase. Be sure to add us to your list of favorites so you can easily find us the next time you need a quality picture frame. Thank you for shopping with us. We are Craig Frames and we are framing the world.one customer at a time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iSnvkznwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Craig Frames","source_asin":"B004EFW9CE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792575","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B004EFW9CE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B004EFW9CE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":792576,"name":"XSC EL Wire Light Up Glasses Neon Party Costume Supplies for Halloween, Christmas, Birthday and Other Special Events (Shutter Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZvseDYhAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: -A fine last minute costume prop. -Can be used on both indoor and outdoor night shows and activities. -Stylish sunglasses frames WITH CLEAR LENSES. -Portable and easy to wear. -Use single button to control four modes: constant light up, slow blinking and fast flashing and shut off. -No heat generated. -Battery pack and eyeglasses separated design giving you a long time enjoying experience. - Accessories for males and females, both young, teen and old. Specifications: Material of frame: Plastic Material of Glasses: AC Connected Wire Lengh: 35 inch Battery Pack Size: 9.1 x 3.3 x 2cm (3.6 x 1.3 x 0.8 inch) Battery Type: 2 x 1.5V AA dry batteries (not included) Attentions: Do not pull the cable between the glasses and the battery pack hard and frequently or it may fall off the glasses. Be sure to use the pack fixed, rather than free hanging, and the cable is not stretched tight. Warm Tips: Sometime you would hear a slight buzzing noise from the battery pack when powered on. It is normal phenomenon. EL wire glow needs a high frequency pulsed power source which frequency falls squarely at the frequencies that are more sensitive to hearing. But it is a weak sound and is easy for most people to accept, especially when you hide the pack at your waist or in the pocket. Packing include: 1 x EL Wire Glasses 1 x Battery Pack (battery not included)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZvseDYhAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XSC","source_asin":"B07H68H7DM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07H68H7DM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07H68H7DM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
