window.products.push({"id":792644,"name":"CozyBlock Automatic Trash Can for Kitchen, Stainless Steel Touchless Motion Sensor Bin, Wide Opening Soft Close Lid, LED Countdown Timer (11 Gallon)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":90.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O9OCUkTeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Thinking of replacing the traditional step-can with an automatic motion sensor can that does an exceptional job yet good looking? Introducing the CozyBlock 40L / 11 Gallon Touchless Motion Sensor Bin with Wide Opening. The CozyBlock Automatic Trash Can is constructed out of brushed stainless steel for a look that's not only giving you the modern and sleek appearance, but also durable and easy to clean. The modern design and sophisticated profile allow it to blend well with most decors and fits perfectly in your kitchen, bathroom or office. Features: -Small yet powerful motor ensures quiet and smooth lid opening and closing -The stainless steel construction underwent a special coating that made the trash can fingerproof and easy to clean -State-of-the-art motion sensor is sensitive enough to catch intended opening but avoid any false opening -The 40L / 11 Gallon version can be placed under counters and other spaces which may have low clearance -Large capacity and compact design, without the clumsy inner bucket -The garbage liner ring keeps the liner sturdy in place, prevent it from dropping down to the can, and fully conceal the liner bag -Extra wide opening makes it easy to dispose milk cartons, pizza boxes or any bulky items; and scrape off food waste directly to the bin -Two way operation – motion triggered or manual OPEN and CLOSE buttons -LED countdown timer count 5 seconds to close the lid once an object leaves the sensing range -Powered by 6 AA batteries (not included) and last up to 1 year of operation -One year warranty against manufacturer’s defects","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71O9OCUkTeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COZY COZYBLOCK","source_asin":"B08886SB4W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792644","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08886SB4W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08886SB4W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":792645,"name":"Sacramento California Skyline by Michael Tompsett, 30x47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g-mWWQ0qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery wrapped art piece features a colorful watercolor skyline of Sacramento, California. Art and design were always Michael's favorite subjects at school. He was fortunate to land a job as a graphic designer at one of London's most prestigious publishing companies. After 12 years Michael Topsett made the decision to pursue a full-time career creating his own work. The freedom and time to be able to focus solely on his own projects has been a wonderful experience. Athrough Michael likes to experiment with different styles and subjects, hi main focus is on map art. He enjoys looking for unique and interesting ways to depict something which is very familiar. Maps are visual representations of the world we live in, a world which is incredibly diverse. Apart from maps, Tompsett creates Urban landmark and cityscape designs. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81g-mWWQ0qL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B017NGYE0K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017NGYE0K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017NGYE0K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
