window.products.push({"id":792874,"name":"Mediterranean Blue Terra Cotta Sangria Pitcher - 1.5 liter / 1.58 quart","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Erpyk6aKL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Sangría captures the joy of summer in Spain - colorful, full of flavor and just a bit intoxicating! What better way to serve the famous Spanish cocktail than with this bright sangría pitcher? In the foothills of the Pyrenees Mountains, our potter throws these terra cotta pitchers by hand, pinching each spout. The pinched spout allows you to pour a glass of sangría without all of the fruit and ice tumbling into your glass. A handle is added, then each pitcher is decorated with a beautiful blue glaze. Once fired, they are packed and shipped directly to our warehouse in Virginia, ready to be delivered to your home. Wash your pitcher by hand. This piece is food safe and has a lead-free glaze. Do not subject to extreme temperature changes (boiling hot to freezing cold) as it may crack the pitcher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Erpyk6aKL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peregrino","source_asin":"B01BI9FXUI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792874","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BI9FXUI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BI9FXUI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":792875,"name":"2 Pack Medium Artificial Succulent Green Plants Fake Decorations in Modern Ceramic Pots, Inside with Lifelike Stone Pebbles, with Gold Ball Linear Sta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yIHVDL97L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"\" While it’s easier than ever to buy live plants online, sometimes, despite our best intentions, those live plants become, well, dead plants. Artificial plants — fake plants, silk plants, faux foliage, or whatever you want to call them — offer a simple solution. They’ll never outgrow their pots, the leaves will never droop down and turn yellow, and there’s no need to worry about watering or fertilizing. They’re also pet-safe and child-safe. Like any living plant, artificial plants can work wonders for any décor situation, and we doubt that anyone will know the difference once they’re displayed on a nice plant stand.No matter the size, an artificial plant can give you the look you’re going for without all the fuss. Material: Environmental Pe/Pp/Eva, Faux succulent plants, and stone pebbles are made of plastic Succulents in medium size, add green and lively decor without taking too much space. Assorted in a geometric ceramic pot, with a Good quality metal stand. The fake succulents would be a good idea for the ones who have pets at home, they can style peaceful with your pets Fake Succulent Plants no need to maintain or care for them, neither will die nor fades, which remains just as fresh-looking and beautiful year after year. Suitable as an indoor/outdoor plant. Perfect addition to your office, home, desk, bedroom, living room, bathroom, kitchen, farmhouse, balcony, or anywhere that you want to put \"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yIHVDL97L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Letinaner","source_asin":"B08T9PBMNB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792875","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T9PBMNB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T9PBMNB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
