window.products.push({"id":792954,"name":"Homykic Over The Toilet Storage, 3-Tier Bamboo Above Toilet Shelf with Toilet Paper Holder, Bathroom Free Standing Space-Saving Rack Organizer with 3 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aC4sf+ITL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OVER THE TOILET STORAGE - With the bottom shelf 33.5\" from the floor, this 24.8” W * 10.3” D * 64.2” H narrow organizer shelf fits most standard toilets, easily fits into space behind your toilet. It is a great idea to tidy toilet papers, shampoo, shower gels, towels, hairdryers, and plants. With 3 removable hooks for convenience use. UTILIZE LIMITED VERTICAL SPACE - The perfect over toilet storage shelf for small bathrooms, a 3-tier freestanding over-the-toilet storage unit helps keep your toiletries organized without taking up too much floor space, you don't have to bend over to get stuff under the sink anymore. Adjustable bottom bar for toilets of different heights. REMOVABLE TOILET PAPER HOLDER - Comes with a removable bamboo toilet paper holder, can be installed on the left or right side of the over-the-toilet shelf, keeping the toilet paper within reach, it is an ideal choice for storing limited space. White color matches most decor styles and beautify your bathroom or powder room. DURABLE & STABLE - Made with solid bamboo wood designed to last. The durable, smooth finish can well protect you from being scratched. Carefully crafted for universal appeal. 2 sets of anti-tilt kits for concerning security, protect the storage shelf from waggle and topple over. WORRY FREE ASSEMBLY - The assembly is easy with the provided step-by-step instructions and hardware pack, you can set it up with no fuss, even if you're not good at handiwork. Wipe clean with a clean damped cloth. Avoid using harsh chemicals. BAMBOO IS BETTER - Not only can it grow 3 to 4 feet a day, but the bamboo is as durable as solid beech or maple wood. It's a very strong kind of wood which is surprising given its gentle and delicate nature. Bamboo can be harvested in 4-5 years, which is more environmentally friendly. KNOW BEFORE YOU GET IT - Please measure the overall height of the toilet with the lid open first. If the height is more than 33”, the toilet lid may become stuck.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aC4sf+ITL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homykic","source_asin":"B09FLS88B3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FLS88B3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FLS88B3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":792955,"name":"20 Pack Twinkle Fairy Lights Battery Operated, 3 Speed Modes Mini String Lights, Extra 30 Batteries Included, 7 Ft 20 LED Waterproof Small Fairy Light","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-uLnyIcAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Upgraded 3 Speed Modes: Compared with other mini LED lights with only one light mode, our small LED lights can be easily turned on/off with just one button, and can be switched between three modes: solid, rapid blinking or slow blinking.More options for your romance Extra 30 Batteries for Replacement: Each fairy light contains 3 LR44 batteries, the battery life is more than 72 hours, which provides longer lighting time than CR2032(48 hours working time). In addition, the twinkle light also comes with 30 LR44 batteries for replacement, which can be easily replaced for longer lighting time. (In order to protect the battery, there is an insulator in the battery case of the new light. For the first use, you need to take out the insulator. ) 20-Pack Battery Operated Fairy Lights: 20-pack of 20 LED fairy lights are made of 7ft long flexible wire that can be bent at will without breaking. The light beads emit a soft warm white light that protects your eyes Safe and Energy-Saving: Powered by extremely low-power LR44 battery and heat-insulating LED wire light, it is environmentally friendly and energy-saving when used without overheating. It's safe for touching. The fairy light string is waterproof (excluding the battery box), and the string part can also be put into water, which is safe to use indoors and outdoors Perfect for DIY Decorations: Fairy string lights can be easily bent and shaped. Can be used for mason jars, halloween, christmas, wedding, room decor or any other unique romantic scene. This mini Christmas starry lights is easy to install without tools, you can attach it end to end to extend to the length you want, making it suitable for different decorating needs","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-uLnyIcAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Merfino","source_asin":"B0BCQKT3WD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792955","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCQKT3WD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCQKT3WD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
