window.products.push({"id":792961,"name":"Canning Lids Wide Mouth for Mason Jars | Canning Jar Lids for Ball and Kerr | Secure Leak-Proof Sealing fermentation Lids for Canning Jars Wide Size (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713UcO9umeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package Content: Regular mouth canning lids come with 100 pieces split-type lids. (the bands are not included) These Canning Jars Lids are sufficient for your daily needs and replacements, Share with your family or friends. Leak-Proof Sealing: The silicone sealing ring inside the lid makes the mason canning jar lids have good sealing performance, airtight and leak-free, tight seal ensures it's suitable for Mason Jars, canning food, dressings, pickles, seeds, preserving drinks and fresh grains. Premium Material: The mason jar lids are made of Tinplate material which makes glass jars with lids difficult to rust, the lids have a high and low-temperature resistant orange rings made of silicone, and it's BPA free. Wide Application: These regular mouth canning lids are suitable for all your regular mason jars and canning needs, store spices, sweets, biscuits, fruits, jams, soft drinks, tea or coffee, nails, screws, and other small objects. Please make sure of the size before purchase. Size Details: Diameter 86mm, compatible with regular-mouth mason jars, not compatible with wide mouth mason jars. If you receive a damaged product or have any other concerns, contact us and we will do our best to offer a satisfactory resolution within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713UcO9umeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Darachi","source_asin":"B08XM4BZ3D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XM4BZ3D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XM4BZ3D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":792962,"name":"RediCheck Remote Cooking Thermometer w/Taste Settings","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Y7XZ7397L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Maverick RediCheck Remote features a transmitter that reads the internal food temperature with a digital electronic food probe, then sends that information wirelessly up to 100 feet away, freeing you from standing next to the oven or grill during the cooking period. When the desired temperature is reached an alarm goes off. Place the transmitter near the oven or grill. Insert the tip of the Food Probe into the center of the food being cooked, and run the probe's lead wire out through the door connecting to the transmitter. The wire is flexible metal sheath and is rated for over 500 degrees F., and isn't hurt by closing the door. The receiver picks up the signal, and displays: the actual internal food temperature, the \"set\" or target desired temperature, and the type of meat. Each meat type has default taste \"doneness\" choices for each type of taste (rare, medium, etc.) but you can override any preset temperature and choose your own. Amazon.com Designed for accuracy and remote readings, this digital Maverick cooking thermometer untethers you from the oven or the grill. You can even lie down in the hammock knowing the unit will signal you when food reaches pre-programmed settings. In addition to gauging internal temperature, the thermometer tests degree of doneness, tracks cooking time with a 24-hour timer, and can be programmed for six different categories of meat. When your roast or turkey reaches ideal levels, the receiver beeps and flashes its alert. Composed of two digital units and a stainless-steel probe on a heat-resistant wire, the kit requires some basic practice at first. After that, use is straightforward and simple. In action, the transmitter shows the current temperature, while the receiver shows meat category, doneness level, set and current temperatures, and cooking time. Each of the digital units includes an integrated stand, and the receiver also sports a clip for your belt or apron. The kit requires four AAA batteries total, which Maverick includes to get you started. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Y7XZ7397L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maverick","source_asin":"B0045BG99Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-792962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0045BG99Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0045BG99Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
